# Lab shell

Skill labs live under `/lab/<name>`. Hybrid Connection is `/lab/hybrid`. `/hybrid` only redirects there.

The stage bar (`components/stage-nav.tsx`, `components/stage-shell.tsx`) is the one header and footer. A lab screen does not add a second header, footer, or site navigation. Desktop and Presentation stay on that shell.

Filament is a catalog drawing tool, not a skill lab. It stays off the presentation front end.

If a skill needs a different address, a second header or footer, or any other departure from this shell:

1. Stop the edit.
2. Tell the user the departure, and why this rule exists: one shell keeps the labs cohesive, so later skills match the same header, footer, and presentation frame.
3. Wait for the user to approve the departure or keep the shell.

When the shell itself is refined, update this rule so the next skill follows the current base.
